From c98c98c2cef0f8382c549e1733424420aeb0a74c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:27:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci(php): run the macOS leg on macos-15

test-php (macos-latest) has failed in setup-php's Setup PHP step in six
of its last seven attempts, on main and on voxgig/struct#178 alike:
"Could not setup PHP 8.3" after 7 to 29 minutes, with php never on PATH,
so no test runs. Every attempt was on the macos-26-arm64 image. On
2026-10-19 the same step on that image installed PHP 8.3.35 in 44 s. The
one recent pass, on 2026-11-09, took 4 min to install 8.3.36, and the
failures began alongside that release. macos-15 takes the leg off the
image where the install broke.

Checks: build.yml parses as YAML. actionlint is not installed in the
session that wrote this, and the leg is unmeasured on macos-15 until a run
picks it up.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U3n7wUnBkRMxEHfh2ckvQ7
---
 .github/workflows/build.yml | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/build.yml b/.github/workflows/build.yml
index 11d762a..a3c05f4 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/build.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/build.yml
@@ -194,7 +194,10 @@ jobs:
     runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}
     strategy:
       matrix:
-        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]
+        # macos-15, not -latest: on the macos-26-arm64 image behind -latest,
+        # setup-php's Homebrew install of PHP 8.3 started failing in
+        # November 2026 ("Could not setup PHP 8.3", php never on PATH).
+        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-15, windows-latest]
     steps:
       - uses: actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1 # v7
       - name: Setup PHP
-- 
